---
description: Laravel logging package rules
globs:
  - "**/*.php"
---

- MongoDB collection `activity_logs` is the only v1 storage target.
- Adapters are stateful and resolved fresh from `LogAdapterRegistry`.
- Do not add concrete adapter methods to `ActivityLogManagerInterface`.
- DTOs should extend `JOOservices\Dto\Core\Dto` where they carry structured log data.
- Repositories must follow `jooservices/laravel-repository` patterns.
- `queue(...)->dispatch()` is async; `sync()->dispatch()` and `save()` are sync.
